line": "Follow the journey of Alex, a talented young musician who is about to achieve her dream of composing a song, only for that dream to shatter after an accident leaves her blind.\n\nAs Alex, you will revisit memories, emotions, and everyday spaces, encountering a diverse cast of characters who will help you find new ways to connect with music and the world around you. Her journey culminates in a final concert, where you will unveil a masterpiece shaped by the very puzzles you solved along the way.", "summary": "Coloratura is a narrative adventure where music and sound guide your path. Designed to be played without visuals, it relies on immersive 3D audio and musical puzzles that accompany the story of Alex, a talented musician facing the loss of her sight.\n\nEach challenge reflects key moments in her life and becomes part of a unique symphony. Both sighted and blind players can enjoy the game on equal terms, with a fully accessible mode that adapts sound design and controls.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/coloratura--1", "videos": [{"id": 190252, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "n_cSzvxXpzE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n_cSzvxXpzE", "title": "Coloratura - Announcement Trailer | PS5 Games", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/n_cSzvxXpzE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 198298, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "WU450XCajms", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WU450XCajms", "title": "Coloratura - Release Date Trailer | PS5 Games", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WU450XCajms/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 201481, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "VRG20NZ3sKU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VRG20NZ3sKU", "title": "Coloratura - Launch Trailer | PS5 Games", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VRG20NZ3sKU/uhddefault.jpg"}]}